TITLE Pure water (pH 7, pe 4) equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas mixture at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.4  10
    CO2(g)  0.4  10
    NH3(g)  0.2   5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -totals C N
    -gases CH4(g) CO2(g) NH3(g)
END
